      "content": "Absolutely, clarity and strategic narrative are key. Our candidate indeed voted against the funding because the final proposal was riddled with exclusionary measures that misrepresented the true needs of our diverse community. When questioned, we should specify that the vote was aimed at ensuring an equitable and just distribution of resources, taking into account all community voices. Our stance is grounded in a commitment to fairness and inclusivity—principles that the community center could embody. Let's prepare specific talking points that reinforce our commitment to inclusive community development and outline a step-by-step plan to revisit the funding proposal. This will show that our candidate's position is proactive and dedicated to upholding community welfare for future consideration.",
